s("insights_patternTag", "On check-ins with {tag}, {quadrant} showed up more often.", "A pattern: check-ins carrying tag {tag} were {quadrant} more often than others. Descriptive only, never 'because'. {quadrant} = Storm/Rain/Moonlight/Sunrise.", "{tag} ఉన్న చెక్-ఇన్‌లలో {quadrant} ఎక్కువగా కనిపించింది.", "{tag} unna check-ins lo {quadrant} ekkuvaga kanipinchindi.", STR("tag", "quadrant"), hi="{tag} टैग वाले चेक-इन में {quadrant} वाले चेक-इन ज़्यादा रहे।", hl="{tag} tag wale check-ins mein {quadrant} wale check-in zyada rahe.")
