s("insights_patternAfternoon", "In the afternoons, {quadrant} showed up more often.", "A pattern: afternoon check-ins (12:00–17:00) were {quadrant} more often.", "మధ్యాహ్నాల్లో {quadrant} ఎక్కువగా కనిపించింది.", "Madhyaahnam lo {quadrant} ekkuvaga kanipinchindi.", STR("quadrant"), hi="दोपहर में {quadrant} वाले चेक-इन ज़्यादा रहे।", hl="Dopahar mein {quadrant} wale check-in zyada rahe.")
s("insights_patternEvening", "In the evenings, {quadrant} showed up more often.", "A pattern: evening check-ins (17:00–21:00) were {quadrant} more often.", "సాయంత్రాల్లో {quadrant} ఎక్కువగా కనిపించింది.", "Evening lo {quadrant} ekkuvaga kanipinchindi.", STR("quadrant"), hi="शाम को {quadrant} वाले चेक-इन ज़्यादा रहे।", hl="Shaam ko {quadrant} wale check-in zyada rahe.")
s("insights_patternNight", "At night, {quadrant} showed up more often.", "A pattern: late check-ins (21:00–04:00) were {quadrant} more often.", "రాత్రుల్లో {quadrant} ఎక్కువగా కనిపించింది.", "Raatri {quadrant} ekkuvaga kanipinchindi.", STR("quadrant"), hi="रात में {quadrant} वाले चेक-इन ज़्यादा रहे।", hl="Raat mein {quadrant} wale check-in zyada rahe.")
